      "message": "[warning] Line 175: 🟡 `inputEnabled_` is assigned before `setupInputBus()` completes. If input-bus setup fails (or aborts partway through), the state can report input as enabled even though the bus is not actually configured, which then affects `startStream`/`stopStream` decisions. Set `inputEnabled_ \u003d true` only after successful `setupInputBus()`, and ensure it is reset to `false` in teardown (`destroyAudioLayer`).",
